msgid "nothing but the request itself, to the company's own website"
msgstr ""

#: src/postulo/plugins/company_site/__init__.py
msgid "Reads the website you recorded for a company, when you press Find logo or Find details, for what it declares about itself: its icon and logo, and the organisation it describes in its markup (names, mailbox, number, profiles, address, identifiers, when it was founded, how many it employs). One page, with the site's robots.txt honoured, and nothing sent but the request itself. Nothing is kept until you say so. Switched off, Find logo is not offered and the site is not read; a logo already kept stays."
msgstr ""

